    "regime_notes": "20-day IC remained positive in 2027-2030 (0.05199), 2031-2034 (0.02748), and 2035 YTD (0.04793), with conservative interpretation due to 15-asset cross-section. Highly correlated with the existing volatility-shock reversal signal; use only if ensemble audit permits.",
